全力で歌うんだ
I'll sing with all my might!

150
00:14:20,074 --> 00:14:22,574
明日の表情
Tomorrow's expression,

151
00:14:22,574 --> 00:14:25,074
水に流したら
if we let it wash away,

152
00:14:25,074 --> 00:14:27,574
何だってやれそうだ
it feels like we can do anything!

153
00:14:27,574 --> 00:14:30,074
落書きの中に
Within the scribbled drawings,

