何でも思い通りとか　そんな美味しい話はないけれど
Things never go exactly as planned, there's no such easy way out, but...

169
00:15:25,826 --> 00:15:30,626
心の曇り空を晴らす合言葉が
The magic word to clear the cloudy skies of my heart...

170
00:15:30,626 --> 00:15:33,226
ほら、快晴でしょ！ずっと
Look, it's clear skies now! Always!

171
00:15:33,226 --> 00:15:36,326
みんなに届けたい　歌もダンスも元気も
I want to deliver to everyone, my songs, dances, and energy!

172
